      "description": "Skip to main content Home Jobs at CQUni Working at CQUni Candidate Profile Search by Keyword Search by Location Clear Home Jobs at CQUni Working at CQUni Candidate Profile Employee Login JOBS AT CQUNIVERSITY At CQUniversity Australia we have an unbreakable belief that quality education, training, and research should be available to everyone – regardless of background, location or life circumstances. If you share our ethos, you will be inspired, challenged and rewarded here on a daily basis. We will provide you with genuine flexibility, generous benefits and practical resources so you can do what you do best. You will play a part in transforming people’s lives in ways that many of them have only dreamed of – that’s a priceless reward in itself. Your job changes lives. Academic & ELICOS Jobs Teach and inspire future professionals through engaging, industry-relevant education and research. Professional Jobs Explore roles in student support, marketing, finance, IT, library services, HR, and administration. Research Jobs Lead innovative research that drives real-world change and industry collaboration. TAFE (VET) Jobs Deliver hands-on, industry-aligned training that equips students with real-world skills and career pathways. Casual Jobs Find flexible casual roles across academic, TAFE (VET), and professional areas to suit your lifestyle. All Jobs Explore all diverse career opportunities and make an impact at CQUniversity. Disclaimer Accessibility Feedback Policy Privacy Right to Information Contact Us Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. CRICOS Provider Code: 00219C   RTO Code 40939   CQUniversity Australia is a trading name of Central Queensland University."
